1. Compare the Triplets
------------------------------------------------

Link:
https://www.hackerrank.com/challenges/compare-the-triplets/problem

Program to compare the scores of two participants.

def compare_points(a, b):
    score_a = 0
    score_b = 0

    for i in range(3):
        if a[i] > b[i]:
            score_a += 1
        elif a[i] < b[i]:
            score_b += 1

    return score_a, score_b


Example

Input
5 6 7
3 6 10

Output
1 1


