2. A Very Big Sum
------------------------------------------------

Link:
https://www.hackerrank.com/challenges/a-very-big-sum/problem

Program to compute the sum of very large integers.

def veryBigSum(arr):
    result = 0
    for num in arr:
        result += num
    return result


Example

Input
5
1000000001 1000000002 1000000003 1000000004 1000000005

Output
5000000015


