3. Diagonal Difference
------------------------------------------------

Link:
https://www.hackerrank.com/challenges/diagonal-difference/problem

Program to calculate the absolute difference between the two diagonals of a square matrix.

def findDiagonalDifference(matrix):
    primary = 0
    secondary = 0
    size = len(matrix)

    for i in range(size):
        primary += matrix[i][i]
        secondary += matrix[i][size - 1 - i]

    return abs(primary - secondary)


Example

Input
3
11 2 4
4 5 6
10 8 -12

Output
15


