5. Rotate Array
------------------------------------------------

Program to rotate elements of an array by a given number of positions.

arr = eval(input("Enter list: "))
k = int(input("Enter number of rotations: "))

size = len(arr)

arr = arr[size - k:] + arr[:size - k]

print(arr)


Example

